ntainer mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center\">\n                    <div class=\"text-gray-300\">\n                         <h2 class=\"section-title text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">Stay Cool This Summer with Atlas Aircon</h2>\n                         <p class=\"mt-6 text-lg\">When the temperature soars in Vadodara, a fully functioning air cooler isn&#8217;t a luxury—it&#8217;s a necessity. If you&#8217;re experiencing issues with your <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/air-cooler-repair-in-vadodara/\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:underline\">Air Cooler Repair In Vadodara</a>, you&#8217;re not alone. From minor issues like low cooling efficiency to a complete breakdown, timely repair services are crucial. Our expert technicians are here to provide reliable and prompt service to keep your appliance working efficiently all season long.</p>\n                         <p class=\"mt-4 text-lg\">We offer transparent, affordable pricing and guarantee your satisfaction. Don&#8217;t let a faulty cooler disrupt your comfort.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Air-Cooler-Repair-Service.webp\" alt=\"Technician performing expert air cooler repair service in Vadodara\" class=\"rounded-xl shadow-2xl shadow-amber-500/10 w-full h-auto\" title=\"\">\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Our Services Section -->\n        <section id=\"services\" class=\"py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 bg-gray-900\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">Our Complete Air Cooler Services</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-300\">From minor fixes to major repairs, we handle every air cooler problem with expertise.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                    <!-- Service Card -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10 transition-shadow duration-300\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white\">Honeycomb Pad Replacement</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-400\">Restore peak cooling performance with fresh, high-quality honeycomb or filter replacement. We stock pads for all cooler sizes—Desert, Jumbo, Tower, and more—ensuring better air quality and efficiency.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Service Card -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10 transition-shadow duration-300\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white\">Fan Motor &#038; Blade Repair</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-400\">Hearing strange noises or have a non-working fan? Our technicians quickly diagnose and perform fan motor repair or fan blade replacement to bring back the powerful airflow you need.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Service Card -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10 transition-shadow duration-300\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white\">Water Pump Repair &#038; Replacement</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-400\">If water isn&#8217;t circulating and your pads are dry, you likely have a faulty pump. We offer quick water pump repair and replacement with genuine parts to get your cooler working again fast.</p>\n                    </div>\n                     <!-- Service Card -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10 transition-shadow duration-300\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white\">Circuit &#038; PCB Repair</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-400\">For modern coolers with electronic controls, our experts handle complex circuit repair. We fix issues with remote controls, display panels, and automated functions to restore full functionality.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Service Card -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10 transition-shadow duration-300\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white\">General Service &#038; Cleaning</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-400\">Boost your cooler&#8217;s lifespan and prevent breakdowns with our comprehensive general service. We perform thorough cleaning, check electricals, and ensure all parts are in optimal condition.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Service Card -->\n                    <div class=\"bg-gray-800 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-amber-500/10 transition-shadow duration-300\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-white\">Body &#038; Leakage Repair</h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-400\">Don&#8217;t let leaks damage your floors. We identify and fix water leakage issues, and can also perform body repairs for assembled or older cooler models, ensuring they are secure and operational.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Types & Brands Section -->\n        <section class=\"py-16 sm:py-20 bg-black\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n       