ra</span> <span>Gorwa</span> <span>Gotri</span>\n                            <span>Haripura</span> <span>Harni</span> <span>Itola</span> <span>Jambuva</span>\n                            <span>Jarod</span> <span>Jetalpur Road</span> <span>Kalali</span> <span>Kapurai Village</span>\n                            <span>Karelibaug</span> <span>Karodiya</span> <span>Kishanwadi</span> <span>Koyali</span>\n                            <span>Lalbaug</span> <span>Laxmipura</span> <span>Makarpura</span> <span>Mandvi</span>\n                            <span>Maneja</span> <span>Manjalpur</span> <span>Muj Mahuda</span> <span>Nagarwada</span>\n                            <span>Nandesari</span> <span>Navapura</span> <span>New Alkapuri</span> <span>New Karelibaug</span>\n                            <span>New Sama</span> <span>New VIP Road</span> <span>Nizampura</span> <span>Old Padra Road</span>\n                            <span>Padra</span> <span>Panchvati</span> <span>Pratapgunj</span> <span>Productivity Road</span>\n                            <span>Race Course</span> <span>Ranoli</span> <span>Raopura</span> <span>Sama</span>\n                            <span>Sama-Savli Road</span> <span>Samta</span> <span>Sevasi</span> <span>Sindhrot</span>\n                            <span>Soma Talav</span> <span>Subhanpura</span> <span>Tandalja</span> <span>Tarsali</span>\n                            <span>Undera</span> <span>Vadiwadi</span> <span>Vadsar</span> <span>Vasna Road</span>\n                            <span>Vasna-Bhayli Road</span> <span>Vemali</span> <span>VIP Road</span> <span>Vishwamitri</span>\n                            <span>Waghodia Road</span> <span>Warasiya</span> <span>GIDC Areas</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n\n        <!-- FAQ Section -->\n        <section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24 bg-gray-900\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n                <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-300\">Got questions? We have answers. Here’s what Vadodara residents often ask us.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-4\">\n                    <!-- FAQ Item -->\n                    <details class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md group\" open>\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer text-white\">\n                            What are your air cooler service charges in Vadodara?\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>\n                        </summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 text-gray-400\">\n                            Our standard visit charge is just ₹299. This covers the technician&#8217;s travel and initial diagnosis. Before we start any repair, we provide a detailed quote for the total cost, including parts and labor. The visit charge is waived if you approve the repair.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                    <!-- FAQ Item -->\n                    <details class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md group\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer text-white\">\n                            How quickly can a technician reach my home?\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>\n                        </summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 text-gray-400\">\n                            We pride ourselves on providing the fastest air cooler repair service near you. We aim for same-day service across all of Vadodara, from Alkapuri to Warasiya. Call us at +91-9727257141 to find the earliest available slot.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                    <!-- FAQ Item -->\n                    <details class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md group\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer text-white\">\n                            Do you use original parts for brands like Symphony or Bajaj?\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>\n                        </summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 text-gray-400\">\n                            Yes, we always use genuine and high-quality compatible spare parts for all repairs. Whether it&#8217;s a fan motor for a Crompton cooler or a water pump for a Symphony model, we ensure the parts are durable and perform optimally.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                    <!-- FAQ Item -->\n                    <details class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md group\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer text-white\">\n                            My air cooler is not cooling enough. What could be the problem?\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>\n                        </summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 text-gray-400\">\n                            The most common reason for poor cooling is old or clogged honeycomb pads. Over time, dust and hard water deposits block the pads. Other reasons could be a malfunctioning water pump or insufficient ventilation in the room. We can diagnose the exact cause during our visit. A honeycomb replacement is often the solution.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                     <!-- FAQ Item -->\n                     <details class=\"bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md group\">\n                        <summary class=\"flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-lg cursor-pointer text-white\">\n                            Is there a warranty on your repair work?\n                            <svg class=\"w-5 h-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"></path></svg>\n                        </summary>\n                        <div class=\"mt-4 text-gray-400\">\n                           Absolutely. We stand by the quality of our work. We offer a 30-day service warranty on all repairs performed by our technicians. This gives you complete peace of mind.\n                        </div>\n                    </details>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Final Call to Action -->\n        <section class=\"bg-black\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-20 text-center\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">Ready to Beat the Vadodara Heat?</h2>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-300\">Don&#8217;t let a faulty air cooler ruin your day. Contact Vadodara&#8217;s most trusted repair experts now!</p>\n                <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"mt-8 inline-block cta-button bg-amber-500 text-black font-bold text-xl py-4 px-12 rounded-lg shadow-2xl hover:bg-amber-600\">\n                    Call +91-9727257141\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        \n        <!-- Other Services Internal Linking -->\n        <section class=\"bg-gray-900 py-16\">\n            <div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">\n                 <div class=\"text-center\">\n                    <h2 class=\"section-title text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white\">Explore Our Other Services</h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-300\">Beyond air coolers, we are experts in a wide range of appliance repairs.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 text-center\">\n                    <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/refrigerator-repair-services.html\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:underline mx-4\">Refrigerator Repair</a>\n                    <span class=\"text-gray-600\">|</span>\n                    <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/ac-installation-in-vadodara.html\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:underline mx-4\">AC Installation</a>\n                    <span class=\"text-gray-600\">|</span>\n                    <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/other-repairing/hvac-system-services-Gujarat.html\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:underline mx-4\">HVAC Systems</a>\n                    <span class=\"text-gray-600\">|</span>\n                    <a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://atlasaircons.com/services/other-repairing/chiller-repair-services-Gujarat.html\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:underline mx-4\">Chiller Repair</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n    </main>\n\n</div>",
